---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Owner Stories | Home Service Hub"
description: "Home service owners on what changed when they followed the steps in the Home Service Hub course."
---
{% import "components/ui.njk" as ui with context %}
{% set list = stories | published(env.production) %}

<section class="page-hero center">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a>{% icon "chevron-right" %}<span>Stories</span></nav>
    <span class="eyebrow">Owner stories</span>
    <h1 class="h1">Real owners. <em>Real numbers.</em></h1>
    <p class="lead">What changed for owners in the community when they followed the steps.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tight">
  <div class="container">
    {% if list.length %}
      <div class="grid-3" data-swipe>
        {% for s in list %}{{ ui.storyCard(s) }}{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="note">
        {% icon "alert" %}
        <div><b>Results vary.</b>These are individual results, not typical or promised ones. Your market, effort and many other things change what you will see.</div>
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="empty">
        <h3>Stories are on the way</h3>
        <p>We are collecting stories from owners in the community. Share yours in the Discord.</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn-discord" href="{{ links.discord }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "discord" %}Join the Discord</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/courses/cleaning/">See the free course</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
